---

## ✅ Shared Binary Data Format Specification

| Offset | Type    | Size     | Description                   |
|--------|---------|----------|-------------------------------|
| 0      | `uint8_t` | 1        | Packet version (`1`)          |
| 1-17   | `int16_t` | 16       | Controller input array (18 entries) |

### Why This Works:
- Fixed-size 17-byte packet ensures predictable memory layout
- Version field allows future protocol upgrades
- All events encoded as signed 16-bit integers
- Includes analog center (zero) logic for analog stick values
- Compatible across Zig and C with correct type casting and byte order assumptions

---

## 🔧 Server Side (`server.c`)

Changes include:
- Reading and parsing full controller state packet
- Updating libevdev with new state
- Sending acknowledgment (optional)

